message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "thermal-hfm: coupled flow and heat transport through embedded discrete fractures in MRST"
abstract: >-
  A third-party module for the MATLAB Reservoir Simulation Toolbox (MRST) that
  simulates coupled flow and heat transport through fractured reservoirs using
  the Embedded Discrete Fracture Model (EDFM) and its projection-based
  extension (pEDFM). It bridges MRST's geothermal and hfm/shale modules by
  computing thermal non-neighbouring-connection (NNC) transmissibilities,
  providing a single EDFM/pEDFM-aware model class (GeothermalHFMModel), and
  supplying state functions for the extended connectivity that fractured grids
  require. Supports single-phase water and H2O + NaCl brine with the Spivey
  equation of state, and state-dependent thermal conductivities.
type: software
